WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.920
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.600 --> 01:35.520
Physician Luo!

01:36.400 --> 01:37.240
It's Physician Luo.

01:46.400 --> 01:48.440
ALL HAIL WHITE ASURA

01:51.640 --> 01:54.720
No obvious wounds on Physician Luo's body.

01:55.360 --> 01:57.360
He likely didn't get
into a fight before he died.

02:04.240 --> 02:06.720
On his left side,
there are leaves and mud.

02:07.400 --> 02:09.440
Fresh scrapes on his left palm.

02:13.320 --> 02:15.160
Drag marks on his back.

02:15.680 --> 02:18.080
He likely fell first,
then was dragged here.

02:23.520 --> 02:25.200
Physician Luo likely fell here.

02:28.520 --> 02:30.320
Judging by the tracks,

02:30.400 --> 02:32.920
his heels dug into the ground,
with scuff marks as well.

02:33.440 --> 02:34.480
The killer isn't very strong.

02:34.560 --> 02:37.520
They were facing the corridor,
dragging the body here with effort.

02:38.120 --> 02:41.160
Your Ladyship, can you tell
when Physician Luo died?

02:44.320 --> 02:45.640
From the rigor mortis,

02:45.720 --> 02:47.880
he hasn't been dead long, about two ke.

02:47.960 --> 02:52.360
Why did they drag the body
all the way here?

02:59.880 --> 03:01.360
About two ke ago,

03:01.440 --> 03:03.240
the line between light
and shadow was right here.

03:03.320 --> 03:05.640
Half his face was lit, half was dark.

03:15.240 --> 03:17.880
His tongue is purple,
with bruises on the sides.

03:18.400 --> 03:19.440
Poisoned again?

03:23.120 --> 03:25.120
You're the Medical Supervisor. Go on.

03:25.200 --> 03:29.160
A purple tongue and bruising
doesn't always mean poison.

03:29.760 --> 03:30.840
It could be a heart attack.

03:31.480 --> 03:32.720
Look.

03:32.800 --> 03:36.040
His nails are purple,
and his lips are dark.

03:36.120 --> 03:39.000
These are all signs of a heart attack.

03:39.080 --> 03:41.360
It may be that his heart acted up,

03:41.440 --> 03:44.840
so he fell and scraped his palm.

03:45.760 --> 03:46.600
A heart attack?

03:48.000 --> 03:50.280
Physician Luo often had chest pains.

03:50.880 --> 03:53.200
I even prescribed him
Blood-Activating Pills.

03:57.880 --> 03:59.000
Your Ladyship.

04:05.560 --> 04:07.080
Did he mention White Asura?

04:12.960 --> 04:14.080
We still haven't found the one

04:14.160 --> 04:16.800
who helped Pan Yongqi
light the pine strip.

04:16.880 --> 04:19.760
But all the signs point
to him choosing death.

04:20.600 --> 04:22.720
The ginseng seeds came from Luo Zhian,

04:23.760 --> 04:25.600
yet he dies at a time like this.

04:26.520 --> 04:29.960
So you mean
Luo Zhian's death wasn't an accident?

04:30.960 --> 04:33.280
A heart attack
is hard to cause from the outside.

04:33.880 --> 04:36.280
In both their mouths
was an "All hail White Asura" talisman.

04:37.040 --> 04:38.960
Their deaths can't be that simple.

04:39.040 --> 04:43.040
Who could have moved Physician Luo's body?

04:49.120 --> 04:50.160
This way.

04:51.440 --> 04:52.360
Your Ladyship,

04:53.160 --> 04:54.960
Physician Luo's desk is here.

05:01.200 --> 05:03.160
- What's this?
- Just a basic safety charm.

05:04.240 --> 05:06.640
Did Physician Luo
secretly worship White Asura?

05:07.240 --> 05:08.560
The whole palace
is buzzing about White Asura.

05:08.640 --> 05:09.760
I've heard the rumors too.

05:10.640 --> 05:12.040
Even you're curious about that?

05:13.280 --> 05:15.080
Talk of the supernatural is improper.

05:17.000 --> 05:18.400
Physician Luo has a student.

05:19.200 --> 05:21.480
She knows his affairs better than anyone.

05:21.560 --> 05:22.680
I'll go fetch her for you.

05:28.520 --> 05:30.560
Medical Officer Zhao Yudi
greets Your Ladyship.

05:37.600 --> 05:39.240
YU JIAN ER APOTROPAIC TALISMAN

05:39.920 --> 05:41.200
So my master

05:41.280 --> 05:43.200
didn't keep this warding charm
on him after all.

05:44.560 --> 05:45.480
What happened?

05:49.120 --> 05:52.000
The one who killed him wasn't human.

05:52.800 --> 05:53.640
It was a ghost.

05:54.320 --> 05:55.160
A ghost?

05:56.200 --> 05:58.600
On the Yin-Yang Road,
a female ghost walks at night.

06:05.120 --> 06:06.520
Do you believe in ghosts, Your Ladyship?

06:06.600 --> 06:08.240
I never believe in ghosts or deities.

06:09.880 --> 06:11.840
If I hadn't seen it with my own eyes,

06:11.920 --> 06:13.920
I'd have called it nonsense too.

06:21.640 --> 06:24.560
A month ago,
Lady Su fell gravely ill late at night.

06:24.640 --> 06:25.720
My master and I went to treat her.

06:25.800 --> 06:28.400
Not until the Hai Hour
did she finally sleep in peace.

06:28.480 --> 06:30.360
Normally, my master and I

06:30.440 --> 06:31.920
take the main road
back to the Medical Office.

06:32.000 --> 06:33.680
But that night, for some reason,

06:34.240 --> 06:37.200
my master insisted on taking
this lonely Yin-Yang Road.

06:39.080 --> 06:42.480
Master, let's take the main road.

06:42.560 --> 06:44.000
This road is truly frightening.

06:45.520 --> 06:47.080
"The wise do not speak
of the supernatural,

06:47.600 --> 06:49.800
not because they deny their existence,
but to keep a respectful distance."

06:49.880 --> 06:53.200
If there are ghosts,
then there must be immortals too.

06:53.280 --> 06:54.840
Our conscience is clear.

06:54.920 --> 06:55.960
What is there to fear?

07:03.120 --> 07:04.160
Who goes there?

07:08.560 --> 07:10.560
Master! You saw it too?

07:10.640 --> 07:11.680
Who are you?

07:11.760 --> 07:13.560
Why linger here at night?

07:17.280 --> 07:18.200
Am I beautiful?

07:22.800 --> 07:23.520
Medical Supervisor…

07:25.560 --> 07:26.880
Is it really you?

07:27.600 --> 07:29.160
- Medical Supervisor!
- Let go of me!

07:29.240 --> 07:30.560
- Let go of me! Let go!
- Save me!

07:30.640 --> 07:32.720
- Medical Supervisor! Medical Supervisor!
- Let go!

07:32.800 --> 07:33.680
Run!

07:33.760 --> 07:34.800
- Help me!
- Let go!

07:34.880 --> 07:36.080
- Run!
- Look at me!

07:36.160 --> 07:39.040
Medical Supervisor, help me!

07:39.120 --> 07:40.960
Medical Supervisor!

07:41.960 --> 07:44.640
Master! Someone, help!

07:44.720 --> 07:45.800
Someone!

07:45.880 --> 07:47.800
Help! Murder!

07:50.560 --> 07:51.600
Master!

08:05.120 --> 08:06.960
I saw with my own eyes

08:07.040 --> 08:08.440
that the female ghost
vanished into the painting.

08:08.520 --> 08:10.680
I've seen plenty of people die of illness,

08:10.760 --> 08:13.120
but seeing a ghost,
that was my first time.

08:13.200 --> 08:14.120
They knew each other?

08:14.200 --> 08:15.360
I'm not sure,

08:15.440 --> 08:18.000
but that female ghost
kept calling him "Medical Supervisor."

08:18.080 --> 08:20.360
My master was terrified
and had a heart attack on the spot.

08:20.440 --> 08:22.280
Did you ever see that female ghost again?

08:23.040 --> 08:24.560
I wanted to go back and look,

08:24.640 --> 08:26.840
but my master forbade it.

08:26.920 --> 08:28.640
Why add to his worries?

08:28.720 --> 08:30.440
I even went out of my way
to get him a safety charm.

08:30.520 --> 08:34.000
But why wouldn't he carry it?

08:34.520 --> 08:35.400
And besides,

08:35.480 --> 08:37.400
why did he go back to this road?

08:42.600 --> 08:43.760
Thank you.

08:43.840 --> 08:47.560
If anything else comes back to you,
come find me anytime.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.720
Your Ladyship,

08:53.800 --> 08:55.640
you probably don't remember me.

08:55.720 --> 08:58.280
I once lived with Pei Yu.

08:59.760 --> 09:00.600
It's you.

09:00.680 --> 09:02.880
If not for your suggestion to His Majesty,

09:02.960 --> 09:04.160
at the Medical Office,

09:04.240 --> 09:07.560
I'd probably still
be someone they could order around.

09:07.640 --> 09:08.960
But now,

09:09.040 --> 09:11.360
I can make house calls on my own
and write prescriptions.

09:12.520 --> 09:13.600
Congratulations.

09:15.120 --> 09:16.040
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

09:16.640 --> 09:17.920
Thank yourself.

09:18.000 --> 09:19.160
And thank Pei Yu.

09:42.960 --> 09:44.000
It was her?

10:23.560 --> 10:24.680
Am I beautiful?

10:28.480 --> 10:31.640
Talent Dong, you are stunning.

10:31.720 --> 10:33.600
TALENT DONG

10:33.680 --> 10:34.880
Talent Dong?

10:35.400 --> 10:36.400
What…

10:37.880 --> 10:38.920
What did you call me?

10:39.520 --> 10:40.680
Talent Dong.

10:41.680 --> 10:42.960
Talent Dong…

10:52.720 --> 10:55.640
Supervisor Luo, you're back.

10:55.720 --> 10:57.480
Supervisor Luo, you're back!

10:57.560 --> 10:59.400
Supervisor Luo, you're back!

10:59.480 --> 11:00.640
You're back!

11:00.720 --> 11:03.240
Supervisor Luo! Supervisor Luo, save me!

11:03.320 --> 11:05.320
Save me! Save me!

11:05.400 --> 11:06.640
Supervisor Luo!

11:06.720 --> 11:07.960
Supervisor Luo!

11:08.040 --> 11:10.280
You came…
You finally came, Supervisor Luo!

11:10.360 --> 11:11.480
- Save me!
- My lady!

11:11.560 --> 11:12.840
- Supervisor Luo!
- My lady!

11:16.720 --> 11:18.000
Supervisor Luo!

11:18.080 --> 11:19.160
- My lady!
- Supervisor Luo…

11:21.040 --> 11:23.600
My lady isn't a ghost.
Please clear her name, Your Ladyship.

11:52.800 --> 11:54.600
Talent Dong loves looking pretty.

11:57.440 --> 11:58.280
She uses silkworm powder.

11:59.640 --> 12:01.720
Those consorts use it
to brighten the skin.

12:08.800 --> 12:10.240
My lady's ill

12:10.320 --> 12:12.440
and offended Your Ladyship
and Deputy Director.

12:12.520 --> 12:14.160
Please don't blame her.

12:14.240 --> 12:15.080
No harm done.

12:16.040 --> 12:19.840
Talent Dong once had the spotlight
and His Majesty's full favor.

12:19.920 --> 12:21.040
How did she end up like this?

12:21.120 --> 12:21.960
DIANJIANG, PALACE MAID

12:22.040 --> 12:24.720
I started to serve Talent Dong
a few years ago.

12:24.800 --> 12:25.760
As for what happened before,

12:25.840 --> 12:28.520
I only heard it from Zhanqing,
who stayed by my lady's side.

12:29.120 --> 12:31.240
When my lady first entered
the palace ten years ago,

12:31.320 --> 12:33.960
she could see up close, not far away,

12:34.040 --> 12:36.760
so she always had to squint
to make out things in the distance.

12:36.840 --> 12:38.160
My lady, look!

12:38.240 --> 12:38.920
ZHANQING, PALACE MAID

12:39.000 --> 12:40.240
That's a peacock!

12:40.320 --> 12:41.840
It's so pretty.

12:43.680 --> 12:46.000
She was always troubled
by her poor eyesight,

12:46.080 --> 12:49.320
unaware that squinting and frowning
gave her a tender, affectionate look.

12:50.320 --> 12:53.000
So, she won His Majesty's favor.

12:53.520 --> 12:56.080
But word is, it didn't last long

12:56.160 --> 12:59.400
before His Majesty
became taken with another, Zhao Baolin.

12:59.480 --> 13:01.880
Zhao Baolin was likely
cast aside soon as well?

13:01.960 --> 13:05.360
There are countless beauties in
the palace, each blooming in her own way.

13:05.440 --> 13:07.720
Even the trends keep changing.

13:08.320 --> 13:09.880
Today it's high noses and deep-set eyes.

13:09.960 --> 13:12.400
Tomorrow, they praise
full-figured, gentle ladies.

13:13.160 --> 13:15.320
The day after,
it's delicate and boneless that's in.

13:15.920 --> 13:17.320
Those who fall out of favor

13:17.400 --> 13:21.200
can only cling to a sliver of hope,
copying the favored consort's makeup.

13:21.800 --> 13:23.480
But Talent Dong was proud and arrogant.

13:23.560 --> 13:25.240
She likely scorned imitating others.

13:25.320 --> 13:27.720
My lady wanted to be one of a kind.

13:27.800 --> 13:31.000
Zhanqing said my lady soon found a way.

13:31.080 --> 13:33.600
She asked Physician Luo for Radiant Toxin.

13:33.680 --> 13:34.880
Radiant Toxin?

13:35.640 --> 13:37.480
How does this life-destroying drug
defies all bans?

13:38.080 --> 13:39.080
Radiant Toxin

13:39.160 --> 13:41.560
can make the skin ghostly pale,
smooth as silk.

13:41.640 --> 13:45.080
But if you take it long-term,
it can cloud the mind.

13:45.160 --> 13:47.880
To win His Majesty's favor,
my lady took the risk

13:47.960 --> 13:49.840
and had Physician Luo
mix it for her in secret.

13:50.440 --> 13:52.320
Luckily, it truly worked.

13:53.080 --> 13:55.920
My lady put on flowing dance robes
and danced for His Majesty.

13:56.000 --> 13:57.240
Her skin was white as snow,

13:57.840 --> 13:58.960
radiant and dazzling.

13:59.880 --> 14:03.000
His Majesty stayed
in my lady's place that very night.

14:10.800 --> 14:14.080
I'd long heard Luo Zhian
rose fast in the Medical Office

14:14.160 --> 14:16.920
thanks to the favor of a beloved consort.

14:17.000 --> 14:18.120
So it was Talent Dong.

14:20.080 --> 14:23.440
Physician Luo climbed the ranks,
and my lady regained His Majesty's favor.

14:24.040 --> 14:26.760
For a long while,
she stayed by His Majesty's side.

14:32.280 --> 14:34.280
That "Butterflies Court a Beauty"
painting in the corridor

14:34.360 --> 14:35.560
was made during that time.

14:37.840 --> 14:40.680
However, no flower blooms forever.

14:41.560 --> 14:42.600
One autumn hunt,

14:42.680 --> 14:44.000
His Majesty had a whim

14:44.080 --> 14:45.880
to break the rules
and bring a few consorts along.

14:45.960 --> 14:49.120
But because my lady couldn't see far,
she wasn't allowed to go.

14:49.200 --> 14:51.040
She went to His Majesty, making a scene,

14:51.120 --> 14:52.720
and only angered him.

14:52.800 --> 14:54.720
His Majesty began to despise my lady,

14:54.800 --> 14:57.760
saying her eyes looked dull from afar.

14:57.840 --> 14:59.160
He sent her back.

14:59.240 --> 15:00.680
Useless…

15:01.480 --> 15:03.520
Useless! All of you!

15:05.720 --> 15:07.320
If you can't fix my eyes,

15:07.400 --> 15:09.680
don't even think
about staying in the Medical Office!

15:10.320 --> 15:11.320
Spare me, my lady!

15:11.920 --> 15:14.480
I have searched the medical texts.

15:14.560 --> 15:16.080
This near-sighted condition

15:16.160 --> 15:18.000
can only be eased in childhood.

15:18.080 --> 15:20.720
Once grown, it's hard to cure.

15:23.720 --> 15:25.240
Hard to cure?

15:28.160 --> 15:29.680
Supervisor Luo,

15:29.760 --> 15:31.960
only you can save me.

15:33.200 --> 15:34.640
Please, save me.

15:39.240 --> 15:41.120
If I have to spend the days ahead

15:42.120 --> 15:44.200
alone in this palace,

15:46.600 --> 15:47.600
then…

15:48.880 --> 15:50.120
I'd rather die.

15:50.200 --> 15:51.640
My lady!

15:51.720 --> 15:53.000
- Let me die!
- My lady!

15:53.080 --> 15:54.000
My lady!

15:56.040 --> 15:57.080
My lady!

15:58.160 --> 16:00.440
- Let me die…
- My lady…

16:02.880 --> 16:03.720
I…

16:05.080 --> 16:06.680
have seen in medical books

16:07.280 --> 16:09.840
that needling can treat this condition.

16:10.960 --> 16:13.880
But those who recover
are few and far between.

16:16.480 --> 16:17.960
So it can be done.

16:18.880 --> 16:19.840
Supervisor Luo,

16:20.920 --> 16:22.560
I beg you to treat me.

16:25.000 --> 16:28.520
But a single misstep
could cost you your sight.

16:29.040 --> 16:31.440
Supervisor Luo, I trust you!

16:34.080 --> 16:35.360
Please…

16:36.080 --> 16:37.640
use the needles and cure me.

16:39.920 --> 16:42.160
So, her eyes were ruined by Physician Luo?

16:42.800 --> 16:44.000
Zhanqing said

16:44.080 --> 16:46.320
after several treatments,
it did help a little.

16:46.400 --> 16:48.200
Talent Dong was overjoyed.

16:48.960 --> 16:50.920
But later,
the southern epidemic broke out,

16:51.000 --> 16:52.440
and the Medical Office sent help.

16:52.520 --> 16:54.960
When Physician Luo
was about to leave for months,

16:55.040 --> 16:57.440
my lady had him needle her more often.

16:57.520 --> 16:58.720
But…

16:58.800 --> 17:00.800
the day after Physician Luo left,

17:01.400 --> 17:03.040
my lady found
she couldn't see from her left eye.

17:03.760 --> 17:05.359
Was it due to his needling?

17:06.000 --> 17:07.599
Zhanqing told me

17:07.680 --> 17:09.800
Physician Luo
had long wanted to shake her off,

17:09.880 --> 17:12.000
so his technique
was always too aggressive.

17:12.640 --> 17:14.720
If he helped contain
the southern epidemic,

17:14.800 --> 17:16.640
he'd win His Majesty's favor.

17:17.280 --> 17:19.440
Physician Luo
no longer needed Talent Dong.

17:20.040 --> 17:23.520
If she'd been treated in time,
it shouldn't have come to this.

17:24.119 --> 17:27.400
No one at the Medical Office knew
he'd been needling my lady.

17:28.160 --> 17:29.840
So when they came,

17:29.920 --> 17:32.000
Zhanqing didn't dare tell the truth.

17:32.080 --> 17:35.360
Maybe they missed the cause,
and my lady's left eye worsened.

17:35.440 --> 17:38.520
Finally, that eye went completely blind.

17:39.840 --> 17:41.120
- My lady!
- Am I beautiful?

17:41.720 --> 17:42.880
- Where is His Majesty?
- My lady!

17:42.960 --> 17:44.160
Am I beautiful?

17:45.760 --> 17:47.080
Am I beautiful?

17:47.160 --> 17:48.000
- My lady!
- My lady!

17:48.080 --> 17:49.200
Am I beautiful?

17:49.280 --> 17:51.160
His Majesty is coming
to watch me dance tonight.

17:51.240 --> 17:53.040
UNVEILED LUMINESCENCE

17:55.480 --> 17:57.320
After Talent Dong lost her left eye,

17:57.400 --> 17:59.240
she could no longer win
His Majesty's favor?

17:59.320 --> 18:00.720
After that,

18:00.800 --> 18:02.160
my lady suffered a great shock.

18:02.240 --> 18:04.720
But she still clung
to His Majesty's past kindness.

18:04.800 --> 18:06.120
She snuck off to see him.

18:06.200 --> 18:08.520
And her blind left eye
startled His Majesty.

18:08.600 --> 18:12.280
So, she was locked up
in the most remote Qinghui Palace.

18:12.360 --> 18:15.240
For over ten years,
she never saw His Majesty again.

18:15.320 --> 18:17.840
Later, I was assigned here,

18:17.920 --> 18:19.560
and I've been with my lady
for two years now.

18:20.160 --> 18:21.400
You just let her carry on like this?

18:21.480 --> 18:24.200
But she's still beautiful, isn't she?

18:24.280 --> 18:26.200
In the first few years,

18:26.280 --> 18:28.440
there were times
when my lady was clear-headed.

18:29.040 --> 18:31.560
But when she was,
seeing what she'd become,

18:31.640 --> 18:34.080
it only deepened her misery,
making her long for death.

18:34.680 --> 18:35.840
Now,

18:35.920 --> 18:37.240
though she's mad,

18:37.320 --> 18:39.080
it's like she lives inside her own dream.

18:39.680 --> 18:41.440
She likes that corridor,

18:41.520 --> 18:43.320
because of the painting there.

18:43.920 --> 18:47.040
In that painting,
she's still the one His Majesty adored.

18:48.360 --> 18:49.400
Zhanqing.

18:49.480 --> 18:50.600
My lady.

18:52.280 --> 18:53.920
Is His Majesty coming tonight?

18:55.640 --> 18:57.280
His Majesty says you should rest early.

18:57.360 --> 18:59.160
No need to wait.

18:59.240 --> 19:01.560
He'll come tomorrow. Tomorrow for sure.

19:02.360 --> 19:04.360
- Really?
- Really.

19:04.440 --> 19:05.920
His Majesty is coming tomorrow?

19:07.160 --> 19:09.280
Then dress me up, pretty and proper.

19:10.080 --> 19:12.800
My lady looks lovely, no matter what.

19:15.160 --> 19:16.480
His Majesty is coming tomorrow!

19:17.000 --> 19:18.880
His Majesty is coming tomorrow!

19:21.720 --> 19:23.240
When Talent Dong
went to that Yin-Yang Road,

19:23.320 --> 19:24.320
did she wear an outer cloak?

19:24.400 --> 19:25.520
Yes.

19:25.600 --> 19:27.200
A black outer cloak.

19:27.960 --> 19:29.000
So,

19:29.080 --> 19:31.320
she hid in the shadows
wearing that black cloak.

19:31.400 --> 19:33.600
Then she took it off,
showing the white gauze dress,

19:33.680 --> 19:35.440
like she stepped out of the wall.

19:35.520 --> 19:37.080
And when she left,

19:37.160 --> 19:38.560
she put the black cloak back on,

19:38.640 --> 19:40.560
like she walked into the wall.

19:42.440 --> 19:44.720
My lady is no longer
as beautiful as she was.

19:45.320 --> 19:48.120
Staring at that painting
is just clinging to what once was.

19:48.760 --> 19:50.280
I came up with this trick

19:50.360 --> 19:53.160
only because I didn't want anyone
to disturb her there.

19:54.040 --> 19:56.800
I never thought
it would spark rumors of a female ghost.

19:56.880 --> 19:58.560
It backfired on you.

19:59.800 --> 20:01.280
Caring for her must be exhausting.

20:02.160 --> 20:04.480
Did she scratch your hand?

20:04.560 --> 20:07.400
Taking care of my lady
is what I should do.

20:08.000 --> 20:10.080
Back then, when Physician Luo
returned from the south,

20:10.160 --> 20:11.680
he didn't learn
what happened to Talent Dong?

20:12.480 --> 20:13.320
I don't know.

20:13.400 --> 20:15.040
He never even came to ask?

20:15.120 --> 20:17.400
Talent Dong lost her left eye,
her looks were ruined,

20:17.480 --> 20:18.640
all because of Luo Zhian.

20:18.720 --> 20:20.480
She had every reason
to hate him to the core.

20:20.560 --> 20:23.600
After that, did they ever meet again?

20:24.320 --> 20:25.480
My lady hates him.

20:25.560 --> 20:28.120
None of us wanted
her going back to that corridor.

20:28.200 --> 20:30.560
But my lady
definitely didn't kill Physician Luo.

20:30.640 --> 20:32.720
Then last night, where was she?

20:33.880 --> 20:35.360
Ever since my lady
recognized Physician Luo,

20:36.040 --> 20:37.280
she couldn't let it go.

20:37.360 --> 20:39.920
She kept saying she'd get revenge
and demand her eye back.

20:40.720 --> 20:42.120
I lived on edge every day.

20:42.200 --> 20:44.120
I fed her pills early
and coaxed her to sleep.

20:44.800 --> 20:46.760
But last night, she still ran out.

20:47.680 --> 20:50.640
The moment I saw she was gone,
I ran after her.

20:54.040 --> 20:55.400
My lady!

20:57.960 --> 20:59.080
My lady…

21:02.760 --> 21:04.760
Seeing Physician Luo utterly still,

21:05.280 --> 21:06.520
I went closer to check.

21:09.840 --> 21:12.200
I found he wasn't even breathing.

21:12.800 --> 21:15.320
I was afraid my lady would be frightened,
so I tried to get her out of there fast.

21:16.360 --> 21:18.760
But when she realized he was dead,

21:18.840 --> 21:19.760
she insisted on dragging him

21:19.840 --> 21:21.520
to the line between light
and shadow in the corridor.

21:22.200 --> 21:24.800
He made her what she is now,
neither human nor ghost.

21:25.400 --> 21:28.680
So she wanted him to never rest in peace.

21:28.760 --> 21:31.920
When Physician Luo fell,
Talent Dong never touched him?

21:33.960 --> 21:35.560
My lady tried to go closer,

21:35.640 --> 21:37.720
but I held her back.
I didn't let her near him.

21:38.320 --> 21:41.000
When Talent Dong dragged Physician Luo,

21:41.080 --> 21:44.320
did she take anything from his body
or leave anything behind?

21:48.920 --> 21:50.280
Talent Dong is pitiable too.

21:50.360 --> 21:52.960
To win favor, she'd do anything.

21:53.040 --> 21:55.080
Otherwise she wouldn't
have ended up like this.

21:55.160 --> 21:59.000
For consorts, the greatest wish
is His Majesty's favor.

21:59.080 --> 22:02.440
Without it, they might as well
be in the Cold Palace.

22:05.360 --> 22:08.080
Mr. Xiao, what are you thinking?

22:10.040 --> 22:11.520
Something still feels off.

22:11.600 --> 22:13.640
If the heart attack was an accident,

22:13.720 --> 22:15.920
then the timing of his collapse
is far too perfect.

22:17.320 --> 22:20.280
Accident or not,
someone will answer that for us.

22:28.160 --> 22:29.480
From the tongue and limbs,

22:29.560 --> 22:30.880
it does look like a heart attack.

22:32.040 --> 22:33.200
If he had this condition,

22:33.280 --> 22:35.400
then normally,
he'd carry pills with him, right?

22:36.400 --> 22:37.240
Yes.

22:37.320 --> 22:39.000
He kept a bottle of Heart-Soothing Pills
on him at all times.

22:39.080 --> 22:41.560
Every few days,
I'd replace them with fresh ones.

22:41.640 --> 22:43.200
And after my master had a few episodes,

22:43.280 --> 22:44.600
I became even more careful.

22:44.680 --> 22:46.840
The pill bottle was in his sleeve pocket,

22:46.920 --> 22:47.760
easy to reach.

22:48.800 --> 22:50.040
We checked during the autopsy,

22:50.120 --> 22:51.000
but it wasn't there.

22:51.080 --> 22:52.120
How could that be?

22:53.280 --> 22:55.240
Medical Officer Zhao, in your view,

22:55.320 --> 22:57.520
could Physician Luo have killed himself?

22:57.600 --> 22:58.720
Suicide?

23:04.080 --> 23:05.000
What are you looking for?

23:05.600 --> 23:06.520
Needle marks.

23:07.080 --> 23:08.600
If my master took his own life,

23:08.680 --> 23:10.120
he'd needle himself first

23:10.200 --> 23:13.640
to slow his qi and blood
and trigger a heart attack.

23:17.160 --> 23:18.240
Danzhong.

23:20.480 --> 23:21.560
Neiguan.

23:24.480 --> 23:25.360
Quze.

23:26.360 --> 23:27.160
That's right.

23:27.240 --> 23:30.240
This special needling technique
is known only to my master.

23:30.320 --> 23:31.600
It throws the qi and blood off course.

23:31.680 --> 23:34.680
After needling himself,
he triggered the attack.

23:35.200 --> 23:36.240
But he was set on dying,

23:36.320 --> 23:38.120
so he deliberately didn't keep
his pills on him.

23:39.640 --> 23:40.480
It was suicide.

23:42.960 --> 23:44.880
But why would he kill himself?

23:45.400 --> 23:46.600
Why do you say that?

23:47.760 --> 23:50.480
Lately, my master
has been favored by Consort Shu,

23:50.560 --> 23:51.400
and in the limelight.

23:51.480 --> 23:55.160
Everyone at the Medical Office thinks
he'll be promoted to Imperial Physician.

23:55.240 --> 23:56.400
He's been waiting for it.

23:56.480 --> 23:57.960
Why kill himself now?

23:58.800 --> 24:02.000
Wasn't it always Physician Liu
who treated Consort Shu?

24:02.080 --> 24:05.320
I don't know how
Physician Liu offended her.

24:05.400 --> 24:07.680
A month ago, she stopped summoning him.

24:10.040 --> 24:12.280
Maybe White Asura helped.

24:12.360 --> 24:14.920
Did Physician Luo
ever mention Talent Dong?

24:15.000 --> 24:16.200
Talent Dong?

24:17.600 --> 24:20.480
The "ghost" you met on the Yin-Yang Road.

24:22.720 --> 24:24.760
My master never again
brought up what happened that night.

24:27.680 --> 24:28.840
Thanks for your hard work.

24:28.920 --> 24:30.640
It's late. Please go back.

24:34.160 --> 24:35.280
Your Ladyship,

24:36.240 --> 24:38.000
if you ever need another autopsy,

24:38.080 --> 24:40.120
I will be at your service.

24:48.160 --> 24:49.280
Could Physician Luo

24:49.360 --> 24:51.320
have grown a conscience
after meeting Talent Dong

24:51.400 --> 24:52.480
and killed himself to atone?

24:53.960 --> 24:55.920
Physician Luo only ever wanted
to climb the ladder.

24:56.440 --> 24:58.200
He was this close
to being Imperial Physician.

24:58.280 --> 24:59.360
Even if he wanted to atone,

24:59.440 --> 25:01.120
he wouldn't throw his life away.

25:05.440 --> 25:08.040
Mr. Xiao, what are you thinking?

25:09.520 --> 25:12.480
About Talent Dong and Physician Luo,
Dianjiang lied.

25:12.560 --> 25:14.080
I thought it over carefully.

25:14.160 --> 25:16.320
When Talent Dong saw me
disguised as Luo Zhian,

25:16.400 --> 25:17.520
she was shaken,

25:17.600 --> 25:20.600
but it looked more
like a plea for help, not revenge.

25:21.760 --> 25:22.920
Let's question Dianjiang again.

25:30.760 --> 25:31.840
Why is it Dianjiang?

25:31.920 --> 25:33.320
This is the ceremonial gown

25:33.400 --> 25:34.640
Consort Shu wore
at her birthday feast two years ago.

25:39.240 --> 25:40.480
ALL HAIL WHITE ASURA

25:46.440 --> 25:48.400
The rack's fixed to the ground.

25:48.480 --> 25:50.280
No wonder it could hold her up
without falling over.

25:50.920 --> 25:52.480
The body's stiff.

25:52.560 --> 25:54.080
She's been dead at least two hours.

25:54.680 --> 25:56.040
Every lead ends in a death.

25:56.120 --> 25:57.520
What does this White Asura want?

25:59.160 --> 26:00.920
Dianjiang killed herself too?

26:06.880 --> 26:08.280
It took some doing.

26:08.880 --> 26:10.080
It's tied so tight.

26:10.160 --> 26:11.520
Could suicide do that?

26:12.880 --> 26:16.720
Pan Yongqi's plan
was to dress up suicide as murder.

26:16.800 --> 26:18.880
But things changed on the spot,
and we caught him.

26:18.960 --> 26:20.960
So he had someone else
light the pine strip for him.

26:22.160 --> 26:23.960
Luo Zhian went
to the Yin-Yang Road on purpose,

26:24.040 --> 26:24.880
so he'd run into Talent Dong.

26:25.480 --> 26:27.560
He wanted people to think
he was scared to death by a ghost,

26:27.640 --> 26:29.400
to cover up the truth

26:29.480 --> 26:30.800
that he needled himself
and triggered the attack.

26:32.680 --> 26:35.400
Dianjiang also died
with a talisman in her mouth.

26:35.480 --> 26:38.440
By White Asura's logic,

26:38.520 --> 26:40.320
it should've been suicide too.

26:42.080 --> 26:44.840
But her hands were tied.
How could she do it?

26:45.560 --> 26:46.800
We'll have to try and see.

26:49.000 --> 26:51.240
Dianjiang once served
in our Embroidery Office.

26:51.320 --> 26:52.160
CHIEF STEWARD
EMBROIDERY OFFICE, PALACE WORKSHOP SERVICE

26:52.240 --> 26:53.720
Her embroidery is superb.

26:53.800 --> 26:54.920
She'd been in the palace five years,

26:55.000 --> 26:56.400
quiet and unnoticed,

26:56.480 --> 27:00.600
until one day,
Consort Shu saw her pattern.

27:01.360 --> 27:03.200
Consort Shu praised her to the skies

27:03.280 --> 27:04.640
and ordered her to make

27:04.720 --> 27:06.200
the ceremonial gown
for the next year's birthday feast.

27:06.960 --> 27:10.080
She even promised her
all the gold thread and jewels she wanted.

27:10.160 --> 27:11.920
Dianjiang was stunned by the favor.

27:12.440 --> 27:14.360
That gown took a very long time.

27:14.880 --> 27:16.920
The whole piece used Yunjian embroidery.

27:18.080 --> 27:20.560
No other embroiderers here
could match Dianjiang's skill,

27:21.320 --> 27:23.640
so almost all of it was done by her alone.

27:25.640 --> 27:27.120
Until that day…

27:29.200 --> 27:30.280
You checked carefully?

27:30.360 --> 27:31.200
Yes.

27:31.280 --> 27:32.640
It can't be wrong.

27:32.720 --> 27:34.120
Does anyone else know?

27:34.680 --> 27:36.440
The moment I found out,
I came straight to you.

27:36.520 --> 27:38.080
I can't let anyone else know about this.

27:49.840 --> 27:52.080
Dianjiang, what are you doing?

27:57.720 --> 27:59.040
Is this gown beautiful?

27:59.720 --> 28:01.640
This is Consort Shu's gown!

28:02.960 --> 28:04.120
Then…

28:04.840 --> 28:06.600
Is Consort Shu's gown beautiful?

28:09.640 --> 28:11.040
After that,

28:12.040 --> 28:14.200
Dianjiang went back to acting normal.

28:15.400 --> 28:17.240
But I truly couldn't keep her.

28:17.840 --> 28:20.720
So I made an excuse
and transferred her to Qinghui Palace.

28:20.800 --> 28:22.840
Her sneaking the gown never got exposed.

28:22.920 --> 28:24.520
Dianjiang escaped death.

28:24.600 --> 28:26.640
But she'd never return
to the Embroidery Office.

28:27.680 --> 28:28.880
I never thought

28:30.160 --> 28:32.480
Dianjiang would still end up dying
inside that gown in the end.

28:33.960 --> 28:36.960
I don't know why she was
thrown out of the Embroidery Office.

28:37.040 --> 28:39.160
But day and night,
all she wanted was to go back.

28:39.240 --> 28:41.120
She cherished her hands the most.

28:41.200 --> 28:42.400
Every night,

28:42.480 --> 28:45.360
she'd soak them in warm water,
then rub on ointment.

28:45.440 --> 28:48.240
Her hands were even softer than my lady's.

28:48.320 --> 28:49.520
But lately,

28:49.600 --> 28:51.480
her hands were covered in sores.

28:52.200 --> 28:53.920
She hadn't sewn in a long time.

28:54.000 --> 28:55.080
Where's the ointment?

29:02.840 --> 29:06.160
Every bit of her modest monthly pay
went straight to this stuff.

29:08.360 --> 29:10.680
This was a gift from Consort Shu
back when she favored her.

29:10.760 --> 29:11.880
White Peony Balm.

29:11.960 --> 29:13.560
Fine and fragrant.

29:13.640 --> 29:15.600
She'd only dare use a little on holidays.

29:17.800 --> 29:19.400
Now her hands are ruined.

29:19.480 --> 29:21.200
She can't even hold a needle steady.

29:21.280 --> 29:22.800
To her, that's worse than death.

29:29.760 --> 29:30.840
Medical Officer Zhao.

29:35.520 --> 29:36.560
Your Ladyship.

29:37.240 --> 29:38.360
I tested it with a silver needle.

29:38.440 --> 29:39.720
This balm is laced with poison.

29:39.800 --> 29:41.560
But it's colorless and odorless.
I can't tell what it is.

29:41.640 --> 29:42.680
Try it.

29:43.760 --> 29:46.040
What a treat.
Thank you for thinking of me.

29:51.840 --> 29:52.920
Rest assured.

29:53.000 --> 29:54.680
Within three days,
I'll find out exactly what it is.

29:55.640 --> 29:56.760
Thanks.

30:01.720 --> 30:04.000
That one… looks nice.

30:04.840 --> 30:07.200
Let go! Let go!

30:07.280 --> 30:08.320
Gu Lingzhou!

30:12.160 --> 30:13.280
Gu Lingzhou!

30:16.680 --> 30:18.800
If this rack had been fixed
to the floor like Dianjiang's,

30:18.880 --> 30:20.480
you'd have strangled yourself just now.

30:20.560 --> 30:22.040
I'm fine.

30:26.680 --> 30:28.600
It's been an hour,
and we're getting nowhere.

30:28.680 --> 30:29.800
Want me to carry you?

30:29.880 --> 30:31.080
No. Absolutely not.

30:32.280 --> 30:34.480
- Mr. Xiao.
- Where's Her Ladyship?

30:34.560 --> 30:37.000
- Investigating at Qinghui Palace.
- Investigating what?

30:37.600 --> 30:39.520
How Dianjiang managed to kill herself.

30:51.360 --> 30:52.400
Peiyi!

30:54.800 --> 30:55.640
You want to see me?

31:00.360 --> 31:02.040
What? Worried about me?

31:02.720 --> 31:03.760
Afraid I'd hang myself?

31:18.800 --> 31:21.200
I borrowed it from Medical Officer Zhao.

31:21.280 --> 31:22.640
I can't afford this if it's ruined.

31:22.720 --> 31:24.520
Is there anything
in this palace you can't afford?

31:25.120 --> 31:28.200
This dummy was made
to mimic real joints and acupoints.

31:28.280 --> 31:29.760
So there is, just this dummy.

31:29.840 --> 31:31.640
Besides Medical Officer Zhao,
only I can use it.

31:31.720 --> 31:32.560
It's priceless.

31:35.560 --> 31:37.280
Why are you making that face?

31:38.600 --> 31:41.160
Mr. Xiao, I didn't snatch this dummy!

31:45.040 --> 31:46.200
This isn't ordinary rope.

31:47.120 --> 31:48.160
It's rattan-fiber cord.

31:49.560 --> 31:51.120
It grows underwater.

31:51.200 --> 31:53.400
Once dried, it's braided into rope,

31:53.480 --> 31:54.600
tough as can be.

31:54.680 --> 31:57.560
Soak it in hot water, and it turns soft.

31:58.640 --> 32:00.320
Once it cools, it slowly tightens again.

32:00.400 --> 32:03.080
That's how Dianjiang killed herself.

32:33.120 --> 32:39.360
DO NOT ATTEMPT. DANGEROUS ACT

33:13.880 --> 33:15.840
But on Dianjiang's body,

33:15.920 --> 33:17.520
there were no signs of struggle.

33:19.120 --> 33:21.320
In her room, I found Softening Powder.

33:21.400 --> 33:24.560
She likely took it
to keep herself from struggling.

33:25.880 --> 33:28.720
So you have solved how Dianjiang died.

33:29.800 --> 33:30.680
Then I can rest easy.

33:32.320 --> 33:34.240
Mr. Xiao, wait!

33:35.800 --> 33:37.000
This dummy

33:37.080 --> 33:39.240
was given to me by Medical Officer Zhao
the moment she heard

33:39.320 --> 33:40.680
I wanted to reenact Dianjiang's death!

33:41.840 --> 33:42.920
Of course.

33:43.000 --> 33:46.520
Everyone's things in this palace
will gladly be handed over to you.

33:46.600 --> 33:47.440
What's so strange about that?

33:48.320 --> 33:49.320
No, I mean…

33:49.920 --> 33:52.040
I didn't snatch it, and I didn't steal it!

33:52.120 --> 33:53.120
I didn't force her either.

33:53.200 --> 33:55.200
I only just learned
she had such a treasure.

33:58.360 --> 34:00.520
How did you figure out

34:00.600 --> 34:04.080
the key to Dianjiang's suicide
was that special rattan-fiber cord?

34:04.160 --> 34:07.840
On Dianjiang's neck and limbs,
besides the rope marks,

34:07.920 --> 34:10.920
there was also
a ring of small blisters from scalding.

34:11.000 --> 34:13.400
So I guessed it wasn't ordinary rope.

34:13.480 --> 34:16.800
White Asura would do this for no reason?

34:18.239 --> 34:20.400
We've had all sorts of scams here before.

34:20.480 --> 34:22.719
Either someone behind them
was after wealth or lust

34:22.800 --> 34:24.560
or it was for power.

34:24.639 --> 34:27.120
Some even wanted to curse others.

34:28.320 --> 34:30.800
But White Asura only wanted to kill.

34:31.400 --> 34:33.840
Now their followers are dying one by one.

34:33.920 --> 34:35.480
What benefit does that bring
to White Asura?

34:36.320 --> 34:39.560
I'm afraid the White Asura now
is no longer the same as before.

34:43.360 --> 34:44.600
There's another issue.

34:44.679 --> 34:46.320
How did Dianjiang obtain that gown?

34:46.400 --> 34:47.239
I looked into it.

34:47.320 --> 34:49.960
A few days ago, Consort Shu's palace
was thrown into chaos

34:50.040 --> 34:52.239
when her parrot, Lady in Snow,
suddenly panicked and flew wildly.

34:52.320 --> 34:54.159
They all went after that parrot,

34:54.239 --> 34:56.480
and the gown
was likely lost during that time.

34:58.120 --> 35:01.560
So the gown's storeroom
wasn't broken into or messed with?

35:02.600 --> 35:03.800
Clean and neat.

35:03.880 --> 35:05.360
If not for Dianjiang's case,

35:05.440 --> 35:07.160
they wouldn't have known
the gown was lost.

35:07.240 --> 35:10.200
Before, there was no time frame
to charge her.

35:10.800 --> 35:12.400
Now, let's see what tricks she has left.

35:13.480 --> 35:14.600
Thanks for going to get her.

35:15.320 --> 35:16.160
My pleasure.

35:59.560 --> 36:00.920
White Asura!

36:01.600 --> 36:02.720
White…

36:04.880 --> 36:07.720
These two packs of fruit powder
were found in your room.

36:07.800 --> 36:11.160
One is the parrot's favorite,
and the other is what it hates.

36:11.240 --> 36:13.360
You controlled the parrot,

36:13.440 --> 36:15.160
helping White Asura
with many tasks, right?

36:15.240 --> 36:17.120
The ginseng seeds under the magnolia tree,

36:17.200 --> 36:18.440
the maze by the altar,

36:18.520 --> 36:20.600
and Consort Shu's gown,
all of it was you, wasn't it?

36:30.280 --> 36:31.720
No!

36:34.040 --> 36:34.880
You can talk now?

36:42.080 --> 36:44.800
I'll admit to what you say.

36:46.400 --> 36:48.880
The followers of White Asura,
though not nobles,

36:48.960 --> 36:53.040
have enough small power
to serve White Asura's needs.

36:53.800 --> 36:56.440
Pan Yongqi is familiar
with the patrol routes in the palace,

36:56.520 --> 36:58.680
Luo Zhian could get
the medicine and poison,

36:58.760 --> 37:01.880
and Dianjiang, being a Cold Palace maid,
had the most freedom to act.

37:01.960 --> 37:02.920
Am I right?

37:04.040 --> 37:05.560
Pan Yongqi's ginseng seeds,

37:06.080 --> 37:07.280
Luo Zhian being favored,

37:07.920 --> 37:09.520
and Dianjiang's long-cherished gown,

37:09.600 --> 37:11.640
it was all done this way?

37:13.400 --> 37:17.200
The blessings White Asura gave us
are beyond anything we could've imagined.

37:17.800 --> 37:20.440
Each one of us just does what we can.

37:21.360 --> 37:24.600
Everything is about
helping each other among you followers.

37:24.680 --> 37:26.080
What does White Asura have to do with it?

37:27.400 --> 37:28.880
Without White Asura,

37:28.960 --> 37:30.440
how would we help each other?

37:32.440 --> 37:34.520
Then why did White Asura cause suicides

37:34.600 --> 37:36.600
and take innocent lives?

37:37.240 --> 37:41.200
Only the most devout followers
are chosen to welcome White Asura.

37:41.280 --> 37:43.080
What an exalted honor!

37:43.160 --> 37:44.760
Tell us something we don't know.

37:46.720 --> 37:48.320
What do you want to know, Your Ladyship?

37:48.920 --> 37:51.320
Tell me about your sister, Gonglian.

37:51.840 --> 37:52.840
By the way,

37:52.920 --> 37:55.440
I also found out that Fuqu
has a sister named Gonglian.

37:55.520 --> 37:58.920
She used to serve Consort Shu
in the flower garden.

37:59.000 --> 38:00.440
One night two years ago,

38:00.520 --> 38:02.680
she jumped from a high building
by the Yin-Yang Road.

38:02.760 --> 38:05.080
Our bureau investigated
and concluded it was suicide.

38:08.000 --> 38:11.160
She fell from the high tower
to welcome White Asura too?

38:12.080 --> 38:15.360
If it weren't for her,
I wouldn't have encountered White Asura.

38:16.320 --> 38:17.680
If it weren't for her,

38:17.760 --> 38:19.800
White Asura wouldn't have abandoned us!

38:19.880 --> 38:20.840
It's all her fault!

38:21.800 --> 38:25.880
White Asura made the parrot
choose me from all the maids,

38:25.960 --> 38:28.000
so I wouldn't be bullied
in the Bureau of Gardens anymore.

38:28.640 --> 38:29.480
And Gonglian

38:30.360 --> 38:33.000
also received
many blessings from White Asura.

38:33.080 --> 38:35.400
But why did she abandon White Asura

38:35.480 --> 38:36.840
at the most crucial moment?

38:49.080 --> 38:50.200
White Asura…

38:53.120 --> 38:54.560
On the seventh day of next month,

38:55.280 --> 38:56.960
I will come.

38:57.560 --> 39:01.560
Faithful believer Gonglian,
hasten to welcome me.

39:02.800 --> 39:05.400
White Asura, how should I welcome you?

39:05.480 --> 39:06.600
White Asura?

39:18.280 --> 39:21.320
Welcoming means having her kill herself?

39:21.920 --> 39:23.000
That's not suicide.

39:23.080 --> 39:27.320
Being chosen to welcome him
is a huge blessing.

39:27.400 --> 39:30.560
Any believer would do so
without hesitation!

39:30.640 --> 39:32.880
But Gonglian not only feared death,

39:32.960 --> 39:35.240
but even slandered White Asura as false!

39:35.320 --> 39:38.760
She claimed she was the one behind it all!

39:39.640 --> 39:41.800
If all this was arranged by her
behind the scenes,

39:41.880 --> 39:44.120
then how could White Asura
enter our dreams

39:44.720 --> 39:47.360
and tell us he was about to descend?

39:49.000 --> 39:50.200
It's contradictory.

39:50.280 --> 39:51.400
It doesn't add up!

39:52.040 --> 39:53.800
White Asura helped her so much,

39:53.880 --> 39:55.120
but she only thought of herself.

39:55.200 --> 39:56.880
No matter what, she refused…

39:56.960 --> 39:58.640
So you forced her to die?

39:58.720 --> 40:00.160
We were helping her!

40:01.080 --> 40:02.120
You know?

40:04.520 --> 40:06.880
She saw White Asura
manifest before her own eyes.

40:06.960 --> 40:07.920
Of course she knew

40:08.000 --> 40:10.360
they would come back for her
after they first descended.

40:10.440 --> 40:14.240
But she was so confused, so useless!

40:14.840 --> 40:16.600
So you killed her?

40:17.360 --> 40:19.000
What's the point of killing her?

40:21.000 --> 40:24.160
Welcoming White Asura
requires true sincerity.

40:24.760 --> 40:26.320
We wouldn't kill her.

40:27.880 --> 40:30.800
Maybe she realized it in the end.

40:30.880 --> 40:34.600
But she left on the very day
White Asura was meant to descend.

40:35.320 --> 40:36.400
It was too late then.

40:36.480 --> 40:37.920
It wouldn't help.

40:39.160 --> 40:40.400
After that,

40:40.480 --> 40:42.920
White Asura never appeared
in our dreams again.

40:43.560 --> 40:44.440
He abandoned us.

40:48.440 --> 40:51.400
How many people knew that Gonglian
should welcome White Asura?

40:53.440 --> 40:55.000
Many followers knew.

40:55.720 --> 40:58.560
And how many people
helped her make the final decision?

41:00.840 --> 41:01.680
I don't know.

41:04.200 --> 41:05.120
Luo Zhian,

41:06.600 --> 41:08.000
Pan Yongqi,

41:09.440 --> 41:10.360
Dianjiang,

41:11.640 --> 41:12.760
and you.

41:15.360 --> 41:16.920
We were helping her!

41:17.000 --> 41:19.480
What if White Asura let you welcome him?

41:24.440 --> 41:25.640
That would be…

41:26.480 --> 41:28.520
my highest honor.

41:33.800 --> 41:37.440
I'll ascend with you.

41:39.080 --> 41:39.920
Wuren!

41:43.240 --> 41:44.160
You won't die.

41:45.040 --> 41:46.200
White Asura won't come either.

41:46.280 --> 41:47.680
Someone!

41:49.240 --> 41:50.760
- Your Ladyship.
- Keep an eye on her.

41:50.840 --> 41:52.040
Understood!

41:56.920 --> 41:58.640
Your Ladyship, I've found it.

41:58.720 --> 42:00.880
Southwest people
are practicing witchcraft.

42:00.960 --> 42:02.440
During the early autumn epidemic,

42:02.520 --> 42:04.360
they claimed to have
a secret method of healing.

42:04.440 --> 42:05.600
No need to drink medicine,

42:05.680 --> 42:08.400
just follow certain rituals,
write on a bowl of water in the air,

42:08.480 --> 42:10.800
then drink the water from the bowl,
and the illness would be cured.

42:10.880 --> 42:12.320
And it actually worked.

42:12.400 --> 42:14.160
Many palace maids
and eunuchs came to see him,

42:15.000 --> 42:16.080
and he made a lot of money.

42:16.720 --> 42:17.560
What kind of person?

42:17.640 --> 42:20.520
The eunuch in charge of night patrol
and timekeeping, Wang Anping.

42:21.720 --> 42:23.840
He has easy access to the palace at night.

42:24.760 --> 42:26.000
Where is he now?

42:26.080 --> 42:27.600
We've detained him.
We're searching his room now.

42:39.120 --> 42:41.920
WANG ANPING, EUNUCH

42:42.880 --> 42:44.240
You are White Asura, aren't you?

42:44.320 --> 42:46.320
No… No…

42:46.400 --> 42:47.640
What do you mean no?

42:48.160 --> 42:49.480
Still denying it?

42:50.520 --> 42:51.360
Yes…

42:52.840 --> 42:55.920
- I am, but not completely.
- Speak plainly!

42:57.080 --> 42:58.760
ALL HAIL WHITE ASURA

43:03.880 --> 43:04.760
Your Ladyship,

43:05.560 --> 43:07.360
I just asked them to serve me faithfully,

43:07.440 --> 43:08.480
promising they'd be reborn

43:09.080 --> 43:11.640
as wealthy and noble souls
in their next life.

43:15.360 --> 43:16.720
Your Ladyship… Your Ladyship…

43:18.640 --> 43:21.520
They only gave me offerings!

43:21.600 --> 43:22.880
But it was all voluntary!

43:24.600 --> 43:27.920
I just wanted to make some money.

43:28.000 --> 43:29.920
I never planned to cause anyone's death.

43:30.000 --> 43:31.920
The killings by White Asura
have nothing to do with me.

43:32.680 --> 43:34.960
Their deaths have nothing to do with you?

43:35.040 --> 43:35.880
What about Gonglian?

43:35.960 --> 43:38.400
The Palace Investigation Bureau
already investigated.

43:38.480 --> 43:39.640
Gonglian…

43:40.520 --> 43:41.960
committed suicide.

43:42.680 --> 43:45.800
You egged on those followers
and pushed her to her death.

43:45.880 --> 43:47.240
Your hands may be clean of this,

43:47.320 --> 43:49.160
but that doesn't make you innocent.

43:49.840 --> 43:51.840
But I didn't kill her!

43:52.360 --> 43:54.680
Even if you bring me before His Majesty,

43:54.760 --> 43:56.760
I am not guilty.
